# `take_any` returns a non-null value of the group (this engine returns the smallest).
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/customers.csv'
| summarize any = take_any(country), name = take_any(name) by country
| sort by country asc nulls first
---- expected
country | any    | name
string  | string | string
--------+--------+-------------
null    | null   | Jo Martin
BG      | BG     | Ivan Petrov
BR      | BR     | Ana Silva
CN      | CN     | Chen Wei
CZ      | CZ     | Dana Novak
DE      | DE     | Kai Mueller
DK      | DK     | Gus Larsen
IL      | IL     | Eli Cohen
JO      | JO     | Mo Haddad
JP      | JP     | Hana Sato
MA      | MA     | Fatima Zahra
NG      | NG     | Ben Okafor
